    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/2f471e6116809b6f148c82d4262a0b76.avif?t=1749998742\" width=792 height=131 /></span>\u300aFlan's BN\u300bis the prequel to \u300aFlan's MS\u300b, which combines JRPG and deckbuilder mechanics. Experience Flan's story of self-discovery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/19ac15c5d651ebf0a2127d945904a145.poster.avif?t=1749998742\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/19ac15c5d651ebf0a2127d945904a145.gif?t=1749998742\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/f4246cb9ef774d03b80805c9c89df271.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all happened\u00a0before\u00a0the Scarlet Mist Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0girl\u00a0came\u00a0in\u00a0and\u00a0out\u00a0of\u00a0library\u00a0in\u00a0her\u00a0activity\u00a0time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She had read countless books over hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Recently\u00a0,\u00a0she\u00a0came\u00a0up\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0question,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Who am 'I' ?&quot;,\u00a0she\u00a0asked\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0this\u00a0question,\u00a0she\u00a0decided\u00a0to\u00a0write\u00a0a\u00a0story\u00a0about\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe she will find the answer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/bf4cbc182948a3a180b6cf225d112e89.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has four chapters and playthrough time of more than five hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay consists of two parts: Activity Time and Bedtime Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activity Time:</strong> <br>Every night, you can explore Scarlet Devil Mansion. Try to find new books, friends and special cards. Also, you may have a chance to uncover the hidden truth of this mystery vampire mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bedtime Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the worlds of each book, you can meet different friends, choose your cards freely for battles and experience amazing stories with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.poster.avif?t=1749998742\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.webm?t=1749998742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.mp4?t=1749998742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/56eae0a2d8148f44762971482f36bd6d.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique\u00a0pixel\u00a0art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build\u00a0your\u00a0team\u00a0and\u00a0card\u00a0deck\u00a0freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free\u00a0exploration\u00a0of\u00a0Scarlet Devil Mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertaining\u00a0adaptations\u00a0of\u00a0classic\u00a0literature\u00a0works</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/2f471e6116809b6f148c82d4262a0b76.avif?t=1749998742\" width=792 height=131 /></span>\u300aFlan's BN\u300bis the prequel to \u300aFlan's MS\u300b, which combines JRPG and deckbuilder mechanics. Experience Flan's story of self-discovery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/19ac15c5d651ebf0a2127d945904a145.poster.avif?t=1749998742\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/19ac15c5d651ebf0a2127d945904a145.gif?t=1749998742\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/f4246cb9ef774d03b80805c9c89df271.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all happened\u00a0before\u00a0the Scarlet Mist Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0girl\u00a0came\u00a0in\u00a0and\u00a0out\u00a0of\u00a0library\u00a0in\u00a0her\u00a0activity\u00a0time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She had read countless books over hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Recently\u00a0,\u00a0she\u00a0came\u00a0up\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0question,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Who am 'I' ?&quot;,\u00a0she\u00a0asked\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0this\u00a0question,\u00a0she\u00a0decided\u00a0to\u00a0write\u00a0a\u00a0story\u00a0about\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe she will find the answer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/bf4cbc182948a3a180b6cf225d112e89.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has four chapters and playthrough time of more than five hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay consists of two parts: Activity Time and Bedtime Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activity Time:</strong> <br>Every night, you can explore Scarlet Devil Mansion. Try to find new books, friends and special cards. Also, you may have a chance to uncover the hidden truth of this mystery vampire mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bedtime Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the worlds of each book, you can meet different friends, choose your cards freely for battles and experience amazing stories with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.poster.avif?t=1749998742\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.webm?t=1749998742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/69276b06af34fc1e413b24284cf43116.mp4?t=1749998742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/56eae0a2d8148f44762971482f36bd6d.avif?t=1749998742\" width=229 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique\u00a0pixel\u00a0art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build\u00a0your\u00a0team\u00a0and\u00a0card\u00a0deck\u00a0freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free\u00a0exploration\u00a0of\u00a0Scarlet Devil Mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertaining\u00a0adaptations\u00a0of\u00a0classic\u00a0literature\u00a0works</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
